        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "Polymerizations were performed with 40 mg TMPMT, $1 . 2 \\times 1 0 ^ { - 3 } \\mathrm { M }$thiophene in 0.1 M TBAFB/AN/BFEE, in an UV–cell equipped with Pt working and counter electrodes and an $\\mathrm { \\mathbf { A g } / A g ^ { + } }$reference electrode. Constant potential electrolyses were run at 1.5 V for 60 min at room temperature under inert atmosphere. The free standing films were vigorously washed with AN to remove unreacted monomer."
      },
